zr605y3dr.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.20740740740740743,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":60319,\"title\":\"Tu cara me suena\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oVM2gLdB6PBDbFjGUb5jzJM8Mbq.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.2,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":61594,\"title\":\"Tu cara me suena mini\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/A3RwrWwVPcRb1Xn6pUocYUfo0oq.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.2,\"_genreOverlap\":1}],\"seasonNumber\":1,\"seasonName\":\"Season 1\",\"seasonOverview\":\"\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jP8KqhxncZT7qshoCDmlofD7yaX.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2019-09-28\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"Horsebeard Man!\",\"overview\":\"Somewhere at a neighborhood yard sale... The Aquabats! meet a lonely wanderer, who offers them a simpler life - without technology!  Will this lone mountain man guide The Aquabats to a higher plane, free of the weight of electronics and carrot sticks?  Will they abandon their luxurious BattleTram vanlife for the desert?\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-09-28\",\"runtime\":10},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Martian Girl!\",\"overview\":\"It's just another day at Fake Lake for The Aquabats! and some daring kids (Ohana Boys) with a sweet bike jump.\\n\\nThe Aquabats! attempt to have a relaxing fishing trip, but they encounter a hungry interstellar traveler... an alien... a space being... a Martian Girl!\\n\\nMartian Girl threatens the safety of the stunt jumpers, The Aquabats, AND THE PLANET! Will our heroes be able to save us from her curiosity with the help of The Men in Purple?\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-10-26\",\"runtime\":9},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"The Mauler!\",\"overview\":\"Somewhere at a Festive Grand Opening... The Aquabats' live grocery store services are interrupted by the Rock (no, not THE Rock) known as The Mauler. The Aquabats will depend on their wits as well as the services of The Invisible Man and Dwayne Johnson (no, not THAT Dwayne Johnson).\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-11-10\",\"runtime\":10},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Lotto Fever!\",\"overview\":\"After The Aquabats! narrowly escape the clutches of The Mauler thanks to the help of Dwayne Johnson... it’s time for some deal hunting and grocery shopping!\\n\\nBut when The Aquabats arrive back at The Battletram, it becomes obvious that their Noodles in a Bottle aren’t quite what they seem. A tiny green fish could change the course of their lives forever!\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-11-24\",\"runtime\":11},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Ninja Kidz!\",\"overview\":\"The Aquabats! scope out a bank to try to preemptively stop some bank robbers that have evaded them.  While chatting with a security guard, something goes wrong.  Will The Aquabats! be able to protect the bank and their egos?\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-12-22\",\"runtime\":8},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"No Fit Shape!\",\"overview\":\"When The Aquabats save a rare plant from extinction, they find it has an irresistible magical power.\\n\\nWill the Pudding Plant change the course of The Aquabats' lives forever? Is that pudding really as good as it looks? Is the sweet taste of pudding worth the weight gain journey.  Find out in the full episode of NO FIT SHAPE!\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-01-25\",\"runtime\":12},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"EagleBones Gets A Cape!\",\"overview\":\"The Aquabats! have tamed a rowdy group of street magicians, but when they attend their new friend The Fabulous Greg's magic show, EagleBones learns the secret to his powers... and gets some for himself! Can Eaglebones harness his new magical abilities, or will he change the lives of The Aquabats! forever??!\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-03-07\",\"runtime\":8},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Pizza Pocket!\",\"overview\":\"When Crash McLarson sees a tasty pizza pocket on a road trip pit stop, he can't help but want it for himself... but this thing costs a buck fifty! It's time to search the Battletram cushions for change and break the piggy bank. Will he be able to find enough money to make this last gas station goodie his? Or will he get hangry and... emotional?? Find out!\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-03-28\",\"runtime\":6},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Shrinky Bats!\",\"overview\":\"When a mad scientist with a shrink ray decides he wants a toy Battletram of his own, The Aquabats find they're suddenly a fraction of their former selves!  Will they escape the evil clutches of Dr. Parnell J. Robinson? Or will they forever find themselves among Barbies and GI Joes??\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-05-11\",\"runtime\":9},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Clowny Clown Clown! 1\",\"overview\":\"Wow! Clowny Clown Clown has an awesome TV show! It's got singing and puppies and candy pie!! It's The Aquabats' dream to go visit Clowny Clown Clown at his studio... His colorful circus world seems amazing! What could go wrong??? Probably nothing!\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2021-05-26\",\"runtime\":9},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"Clowny Clown Clown! 2\",\"overview\":\"Oh boy! The Aquabats have been invited to Clowny Clown Clown's TV studio to meet puppies and eat candy pie!! Ricky's not too sure about it but... what does he know!!? Will he overcome his fear of clowns and have the best day ever?? Find out!\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2021-07-31\",\"runtime\":8},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"Spider Hunter!\",\"overview\":\"The Aquabats! enjoy a day at the park until a GIANT SPIDER terrorizes. Crash calls for help using his 'shell' phone, but things only get worse.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2025-02-22\",\"runtime\":9}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2019-09-28\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}